Keep this directory (and its parent) free of any *.pub key.
GOPASS_SSH_DIR points at the parent dir so gopass's age backend finds zero SSH
identities here instead of scanning ~/.ssh (workaround for gopasspw/gopass#3509
on gopass <= 1.16.1: an SSH identity sent to the age agent breaks SendIdentities
~50% of the time due to Go map iteration order, leaving the agent empty and
re-prompting on every call).
